id: need-for-revenge-mark
name: Need for Revenge
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: Need for Revenge (4)'s - its x(bT), the giver's Base Tier, as stacks.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Need for Revenge: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack, till the end of your next turn.
text: >
  Need for Revenge (4): Target an Ally, they regain 2x(bT) Life and Ki Points and their Combat Rolls are increased by x(bT) until the end of their next turn.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
